{"t": 121.02, "e": 124.2, "line": "My number's quick, yeah, it isn't even hard"},
{"t": 124.39, "e": 127.62, "line": "Then I'm going home, I painted every wall"},
{"t": 127.72, "e": 131.5, "line": "Pink sheets, white frame, plants up in the hall"},
{"t": 131.53, "e": 134.76, "line": "I'm up the stairs, there's a room for you"},
{"t": 135.03, "e": 138.41, "line": "Wave from the window, I can see you too"},
{"t": 138.41, "e": 142.14, "line": "Everybody's here and we're all in one place"},
